fixture tech11_teleport_crouches_into_low_gap
doc Task 3 review round 2, L13: BUILD.md s6 Ember Toss "press again to teleport to it"; s5 Ground "Crouch: Hitbox 44 to 28 tall"; docs/adr/0010 "A press while the ember is out moves the body to the nearest spot around the ember where it fits, within 24 u". An ember flying through a 32 u tall gap: the standing body does not fit there, so the teleport tries a crouched one, which does, and the player arrives crouched in the gap.
room test/lowgap
spawn 600 544
frames 40
input
  0 R toss
  # The ember is inside the gap (640..800) on frames 6 to 21.
  12 toss
  13..39 -
end
expect
  at 11 ember=1 ember_x>650u ember_x<790u
  # The teleport should happen (crouched into the gap), or at least not swallow the press.
  at 12 event.teleport=1 crouch=1 height=28
end
